\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces \New  Point-source propagators (12 columns) on $24^3\times 48$. The multigrid columns give the setup seconds, the iterations and the seconds per column; the CGNE columns (mixed precision) give the iterations and seconds per column; the last columns give the wall time of the whole propagator. At $m=0.001$ the entries are ranges over the four configurations and the 12 columns; at $m=0.01$ they are for configuration~1. \New  Both solvers stop at $|D\psi -\eta |^2/|\eta |^2<10^{-18}$. Each propagator performs its own multigrid setup. The wall time is that of the whole process and includes reading and smearing the configuration, the initialization and the correlator.}}{29}{table.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:pointsource}{{6}{29}{\New Point-source propagators (12 columns) on $24^3\times 48$. The multigrid columns give the setup seconds, the iterations and the seconds per column; the CGNE columns (mixed precision) give the iterations and seconds per column; the last columns give the wall time of the whole propagator. At $m=0.001$ the entries are ranges over the four configurations and the 12 columns; at $m=0.01$ they are for configuration~1. \New Both solvers stop at $|D\psi -\eta |^2/|\eta |^2<10^{-18}$. Each propagator performs its own multigrid setup. The wall time is that of the whole process and includes reading and smearing the configuration, the initialization and the correlator}{table.6}{}}
